Team Jeopardy
=============

This project includes ingest ideas and simplified ports derived from:

  jmjava/skgraph (private)
  https://github.com/jmjava/skgraph

Specifically adapted in-repo (Java, no skgraph-core dependency):
  - Maven POM reactor walk / dependency projection (from skgraph PomParser,
    MavenReactorBuilder, RelaxedDependencyGraphBuilder concepts)
  - Lightweight OSGi MANIFEST / bnd symbolic-name extraction
    (from skgraph OsgiExtractor / ManifestParser concepts)

Gradle multi-project and Vue SFC / package.json ingest are original extensions
in this repository that share the same CodeGraph model.
